WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:03.389
"Ringo, Lucy!"

2
00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:06.524
Captain Nova's voice came through a speaker.

3
00:00:06.525 --> 00:00:08.751
"Come to my office!"

4
00:00:08.752 --> 00:00:20.253
Ringo and Lucy ran quickly.

5
00:00:20.254 --> 00:00:24.730
"Go to Gem Planet—fast!" Captain Nova said.

6
00:00:24.731 --> 00:00:27.410
"Miners are trapped in a mine!"

7
00:00:27.411 --> 00:00:37.714
Ringo nodded. "We'll save them!"

8
00:00:37.715 --> 00:00:40.241
Bot flew the spaceship.

9
00:00:40.242 --> 00:00:44.430
"Gem Planet is very important," she said.

10
00:00:44.431 --> 00:00:49.292
"That's where everyone gets space gems."

11
00:00:49.293 --> 00:00:52.862
"Space gems are valuable," PJ said.

12
00:00:52.863 --> 00:00:55.369
"They're used in computers."

13
00:00:55.370 --> 00:01:07.298
"I can't wait to see the gems," Ringo said.

14
00:01:07.299 --> 00:01:15.595
Finally they landed near the mine.

15
00:01:15.596 --> 00:01:19.578
Ringo and Lucy put on helmets.

16
00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:27.010
The helmets had radios.

17
00:01:27.011 --> 00:01:34.633
Everyone went inside.

18
00:01:34.634 --> 00:01:38.463
Gems sparkled in the walls.

19
00:01:38.464 --> 00:01:46.740
"Wow!" Bot said.

20
00:01:46.741 --> 00:01:48.942
Ringo talked on the radio.

21
00:01:48.943 --> 00:01:51.688
"Can anyone hear me?" he said.

22
00:01:51.689 --> 00:01:54.920
"I'm from Space Patrol."

23
00:01:54.921 --> 00:01:58.175
"Help us!" a voice said.

24
00:01:58.176 --> 00:02:00.052
"A tunnel caved in.

25
00:02:00.053 --> 00:02:02.804
Then a machine fell on us!"

26
00:02:02.805 --> 00:02:05.416
"Don't worry," Ringo said.

27
00:02:05.417 --> 00:02:09.987
"We'll get you out of there."

28
00:02:09.988 --> 00:02:13.670
"Thank you!" the voice said.

29
00:02:13.671 --> 00:02:18.254
"We're just doing our job," Ringo said.

30
00:02:18.255 --> 00:02:22.506
Just then something landed on his helmet.

31
00:02:22.507 --> 00:02:29.914
He looked up. "Ahh! A bug!"

